    pr_ref:  # bff0
    description: "**Found via self-analysis dogfooding on 2026-05-16 (round 5).**\n\n**Symptom.** Hypergumbo's own behavior map output **fails schema validation** against `docs/schema.json`. Two distinct problems surface from one conformance run.\n\n**Sub-issue (a): producer emits `line=0`, violating schema's `Edge.line minimum: 1`.**\n\n```\nschema validation: FAILED at path ['edges', 96247, 'line']\n  message: 0 is less than the minimum of 1\n```\n\n26 edges in the self-analysis output have `line=0`. Breakdown:\n\n- All 26 are `type=module_exports`\n- All 26 carry `origin=js-module-linker-v1`\n\nRoot cause at `packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/linkers/js_module.py:811`:\n\n```python\nnew_edges.append(Edge.create(\n    src=mod_sym.id,\n    dst=file_sym.id,\n    edge_type=\"module_exports\",\n    line=0,                      # ← hardcoded\n    origin=PASS_ID,\n    ...\n))\n```\n\nThe intent is plausible — a `module_exports` edge is a synthesized \"this module exports this symbol\" relationship that has no specific source line — but `Edge.line` is constrained to `minimum: 1` in the schema, so emitting `line=0` is a contract violation.\n\n**Sub-issue (b): three top-level keys produced but not declared in schema.**\n\nSchema's `BehaviorMap.properties` lists 15 fields; data produces 18 top-level keys. The three extras:\n\n| Key | Type | Sample |\n|---|---|---|\n| `entrypoints` | list of 64 | `{confidence, kind, label, symbol_id}` |\n| `sketch_precomputed` | dict | `{centrality_scores, config_info, readme_description, vocabulary}` |\n| `usage_contexts` | list of 8 | per ADR-0003-ext usage_context_patterns |\n\nConsumers using `docs/schema.json` to validate hypergumbo output (the documented public contract) will fail on hypergumbo's own JSON.\n\n**Invariant.** Hypergumbo's own behavior map output must validate against the schema it documents. Either:\n\n1. The producer side is wrong (emit line ≥ 1; or undeclared keys shouldn't be emitted), OR\n2. The schema is stale (lower line bound to 0; declare entrypoints / sketch_precomputed / usage_contexts as properties)\n\nFor (a), the right fix is probably **schema relaxation** — `line=0` is a legitimate sentinel for \"synthesized edge without a source line.\" Set `minimum: 0` on `Edge.line`, OR make `line` optional, OR add a `synthesized: true` discriminator that exempts the line constraint.\n\nFor (b), the right fix is **schema extension** — the three keys are real, useful output, and consumers should be able to read them via schema-driven generation. Add them to `BehaviorMap.properties`. Bump `SCHEMA_VERSION` (currently 0.8.0) appropriately.\n\n**Fix proposal.**\n\n1. `docs/schema.json`: lower `Edge.line` minimum to 0 (or add a `synthesized` discriminator). Add `entrypoints`, `sketch_precomputed`, `usage_contexts` to `BehaviorMap.properties` with referenced type definitions. Bump `SCHEMA_VERSION`.\n2. Add a CI gate: a property test that runs `hypergumbo run .` on a fixture (or on hypergumbo itself) and asserts the output validates against the current `docs/schema.json`. Without this gate, future drift will recur.\n3. Migration: the schema bump should record the change in `CHANGELOG.md` schema-version section.\n\n**Cross-references.**\n\n- `packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/linkers/js_module.py:807-820` — line=0 site\n- `docs/schema.json` — top-level `BehaviorMap` properties + `Edge.line` constraint\n- `packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/schema.py:SCHEMA_VERSION` — version bump location\n- `packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/ir.py:Edge` dataclass (lines 422-466) — producer-side serialization\n\n**Notebook reference.** `~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/notebookjournal_05162026_0438.md` Round 5 section."  # bff0
    fields:  # bff0
      statement: "Hypergumbo's own behavior map output must validate against the schema documented at docs/schema.json. Consumers using the documented schema to validate hypergumbo output (the public contract) must succeed on hypergumbo's own JSON."  # bff0
      root_cause: "Two distinct contract gaps: (a) packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/linkers/js_module.py:811 hardcodes line=0 on module_exports edges, violating schema's Edge.line minimum: 1 constraint. (b) Three top-level keys (entrypoints, sketch_precomputed, usage_contexts) are produced by the CLI but not declared in docs/schema.json's BehaviorMap.properties. No CI gate currently asserts schema conformance of produced output."  # bff0
