  message: "Cross-item review 2026-05-17: sub-issue (b) — three undeclared top-level keys (entrypoints, sketch_precomputed, usage_contexts) — intersects with the dead-schema-field cluster. entrypoints is then constrained by INV-tajap (Python-only detection). sketch_precomputed is a sketch-build optimization payload. usage_contexts is a per-ADR-0003-ext output. Whether to add these to docs/schema.json depends on whether they're contracted output or internal — pick before treating this as a doc-only fix. Sub-issue (a) (line=0 from js-module-linker) is independent of (b) and ships fine alone."  # f309
